                                "sense_id": "9fc7854a-b2ab-3fa1-9ed6-bdea0d1acecc",
                                "text": "The alliance has never been one between equal partners but has always been based on the idea of patronship of one social class over another. Patronship is assumed by the group which is considered to be both ideologically and culturally at a higher level of development and which, on the strength of this, gives friendly assistance to the group at a lower level."
